[{"answer":"I got my cat when she was just a tiny kitten.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/general-english/65-my-cat-2019-03-29-12-42-40/1.mp3"},{"answer":"I named her Puff because her fur is soft and fluffy.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/general-english/65-my-cat-2019-03-29-12-42-40/2.mp3"},{"answer":"She has white fur, but her tail, paws and ears are black.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/general-english/65-my-cat-2019-03-29-12-42-40/3.mp3"},{"answer":"She has a little pink nose and yellow eyes.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/general-english/65-my-cat-2019-03-29-12-42-40/4.mp3"},{"answer":"She says \"meow\" whenever she wants a bowl of milk.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/general-english/65-my-cat-2019-03-29-12-42-40/5.mp3"},{"answer":"I feed her cat food and treats.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/general-english/65-my-cat-2019-03-29-12-42-40/6.mp3"},{"answer":"She washes her face with her paw when she is finished eating.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/general-english/65-my-cat-2019-03-29-12-42-40/7.mp3"},{"answer":"My whole family loves her, and we can tell that she loves us.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/general-english/65-my-cat-2019-03-29-12-42-40/8.mp3"},{"answer":"She loves to curl up in our laps.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/general-english/65-my-cat-2019-03-29-12-42-40/9.mp3"},{"answer":"She purrs whenever we pet her.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/general-english/65-my-cat-2019-03-29-12-42-40/10.mp3"},{"answer":"She is very playful.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/general-english/65-my-cat-2019-03-29-12-42-40/11.mp3"},{"answer":"We sometimes roll up a piece of paper and throw it to her.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/general-english/65-my-cat-2019-03-29-12-42-40/12.mp3"},{"answer":"She loves to chase the paper and hit it with her paws.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/general-english/65-my-cat-2019-03-29-12-42-40/13.mp3"},{"answer":"She also chases bugs.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/general-english/65-my-cat-2019-03-29-12-42-40/14.mp3"},{"answer":"Last night she chased a spider,","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/general-english/65-my-cat-2019-03-29-12-42-40/15.mp3"},{"answer":"but she was afraid to touch it.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/general-english/65-my-cat-2019-03-29-12-42-40/16.mp3"},{"answer":"At night she curls up in my bed with me.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/general-english/65-my-cat-2019-03-29-12-42-40/17.mp3"},{"answer":"She likes to be warm.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/general-english/65-my-cat-2019-03-29-12-42-40/18.mp3"},{"answer":"I have given her a blanket of her own,","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/general-english/65-my-cat-2019-03-29-12-42-40/19.mp3"},{"answer":"but when I put her on it her tail twitches.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/general-english/65-my-cat-2019-03-29-12-42-40/20.mp3"},{"answer":"Her tail twitches whenever she is upset or angry.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/general-english/65-my-cat-2019-03-29-12-42-40/21.mp3"},{"answer":"I know she doesn't want to be on her blanket.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/general-english/65-my-cat-2019-03-29-12-42-40/22.mp3"},{"answer":"She wants to be in my bed.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/general-english/65-my-cat-2019-03-29-12-42-40/23.mp3"},{"answer":"I let her into my bed, and she falls asleep purring loudly.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/general-english/65-my-cat-2019-03-29-12-42-40/24.mp3"}]
